---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const bookUrl = 'https://calendar.notion.so/meet/cameronearloliver/qc3y04oud';

const shorts = [
  {
    quote: "Straight shooter. Told me the problem was me, not my crews, and he was right. Best money I've spent on the business side of this company.",
    name: 'Tony', title: 'Owner', type: 'Construction company',
  },
  {
    quote: "I'd hired consultants before and gotten a 60-page deck I never opened. Cameron gave me three changes I could make that week. All three worked.",
    name: 'Priya', title: 'CEO', type: 'Telehealth company',
  },
  {
    quote: "Cameron didn't try to reinvent how we practice law. He fixed the twelve things around it that were quietly costing us billable hours.",
    name: 'Jordan', title: 'Owner', type: 'Law firm',
  },
];

const narratives = [
  {
    quote: "We brought Cameron in for what we thought was a reporting cleanup. Two weeks in, he'd found the real issue: we were making acquisition decisions on numbers that were 45 days stale. He rebuilt the operating cadence from the ground up. Six months later our diligence process is faster, our board meetings are shorter, and I finally trust the dashboard I'm looking at. I've already introduced him to two other firms in our network.",
    name: 'Alicia', title: 'CEO', type: 'Private equity firm',
  },
  {
    quote: "I was skeptical. We're a clinical business and most operators talk about us like we're a call center. Cameron was different. He sat in on visits, learned the workflow, and then quietly took apart the parts that were slowing our clinicians down. We didn't add a single person and we're seeing meaningfully more patients. My physicians actually like their jobs again, which I did not expect to be an outcome.",
    name: 'Sofia', title: 'CEO', type: 'Teledermatology group',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Results | Growth Map"
  description="What owners and operators say about working with Cameron Oliver: construction, telehealth, private equity, and more."
  canonicalPath="/testimonials"
>
  <section class="border-b border-hairline px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
      <p class="doc-label text-ink">Results</p>
      <h1 class="font-display mt-7 text-4xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        In their words.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[60ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        A few of the owners and operators I've worked with, across very different businesses.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">"If you doubled your sales tomorrow, would you be happy, or freak out?"</p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">He was chasing more sales, but when I asked him that, he got sick to his stomach. He had a throughput problem, not a sales problem. We fixed how the work got delivered, and the growth followed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-ink">She didn't know where her revenue was even coming from.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-fern">Focused on all the wrong customers, and couldn't say where to find the right ones. We rebuilt the sales process and doubled her growth rate, with no added spend.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        {shorts.map((t) => (
          <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-7">
            <p class="text-moss">★★★★★</p>
            <blockquote class="font-display mt-2 text-[17px] italic leading-normal text-ink">"{t.quote}"</blockquote>
            <cite class="mt-4 block font-mono text-[11px] not-italic leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-fern">
              {t.name} · {t.title}<br />{t.type}
            </cite>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        {narratives.map((t) => (
          <div class="rounded-[14px] border border-hairline bg-white/50 p-8">
            <p class="text-moss">★★★★★</p>
            <blockquote class="font-display mt-2 text-[18px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink">"{t.quote}"</blockquote>
            <cite class="mt-4 block font-mono text-[11px] not-italic leading-relaxed tracking-wide text-fern">
              {t.name} · {t.title}<br />{t.type}
            </cite>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[640px] text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl leading-tight text-ink md:text-[36px]">
        Let's talk.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[46ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fern">
        The first call's free. I'll give you my honest read on where to focus next, whether or not I'm the one who helps.
      </p>
      <a href={bookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-full border border-ink bg-ink px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-parchment transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
        Book a call
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm text-fern">A free 30-minute call.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
